connections.json contains the eye, eyebrow, mouth and face-oval connection
indices extracted from FaceLandmarker constants in @mediapipe/tasks-vision
1.2.0 (Apache-2.0, author mediapipe@google.com). JSON formatting was adapted
for this application's offline geometry processing; the indices are unchanged.
Runtime source: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@mediapipe/tasks-vision/v/1.2.0

Guangyu's crop, coordinate restoration, protected-mask construction and offline
runtime adapter are separate application code. Model weights are unmodified.
